        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>StrtabOffset</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::gsym::Header::StrtabOffset</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The file relative offset of the start of the string table for strings contained in the GSYM file. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If the GSYM in contained in a stand alone file this will be the file offset of the start of the string table. If the GSYM is contained in a section within an executable file, this can be the offset of the first string used in the GSYM file and can possibly span one or more executable string tables. This allows the strings to share string tables in an <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_e_l_f" kindref="compound">ELF</ref> or mach-o file. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
